      "Changelog": "**Gardening (EARLY TESTING)**\n- Add gardens by standing next to the patch\n- Pick a crop and it works out which seeds to cross (Deluxe patches)\n- Harvests, tends and replants for you\n- Step by step guide to add a garden and set up a path, then press Change to pick what it grows\n- \"Get what I can\" buys missing seeds and soil from NPCs and gathers the rest with Gather n Chill\n\n**Bait and bags**\n- Buys only the bait your next few fish need to spare your inventory space\n- Updated rules for cleaning up as you tour\n- Fixed teleports getting stuck during bag clean up\n- Bait page shows why each bait is being kept\n\n**Tours**\n- Skips a fish it can't get bait for instead of showing up short\n- Short of scrips for bait? It can fish collectables while it waits, turn them in and buy the bait. Pick the fish on the Scrips page (Fill waits)\n- Can now work on some achievements during long waits. Turn it on in the Achievements page (Fill waits)\n- No longer arrives far too early for some fish\n\n**Fish fixes**\n- Stethacanthus: better buff and hook choices, so Sculptors get Double Hooked\n- Skyfrond and Moonmarking Saucer: fixed bites being let go, Welkin Catfish now gets slapped\n- Drepanaspis: no longer switches to the wrong bait\n- No more wasting Chum on fish that need a lure",
